{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大ニュース！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白鳥美美子役で出演させて頂いた舞台、\n『學蘭歌劇 帝一の國』の劇中歌を集めたCDを\n手にしてくれた方はいるかな(＾＾)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとその中の楽曲が、\nカラオケJOYSOUNDさんにて配信されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*「未来をつくりだすのは僕らなんだ ここに勝利の旗をかかげろ」\n*「クライマックス」\n*「すみれ、ばら、こちょうらん」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の3曲です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美美子ちゃんの歌パートもあるよ！\n今度カラオケ行ったときに歌ってみようかな(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)\n皆さんもぜひ♩♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月からの舞台『墓場、女子高生』の\nビジュアルが解禁されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな舞台になるのか、\nとっても楽しみです(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Samurai ELOさん発売中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はカジュアル系で、女の子らしいシルエットが苦手なので身体のラインや肌を見せない\nダボッと服装が多いんですが、\nこういうちょっとガーリーな服も新鮮で楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*月刊エンタメ 8.30発売←本日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*BUBKA 8.31発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*UTB 9.23発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、全国ツアー地方公演\n終了致しました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方ラストは福岡！皆さん有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は、各会場ごとにMC担当を代えたり、\n例年以上にみんながそれぞれに責任を持って\n取り組んだツアーだったと思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりキャプテンの存在の大きさと\nキャプテンのいない穴を埋めようと\n頑張ってくれた生駒ちゃんの凄さを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて感じたツアーでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ラストは東京！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日、メンバー全員で神宮球場\n初日を迎えることができて、\n本当に良かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー・スタッフ一同頑張ってきたし、\nお客さんの温かい支えもあって、\n雨なんかに絶対負けないぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最終日、どうか晴れますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮ろって言ったらこの顔してくれたよ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中、見て下さった方\n有難うございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメで「最近、あることを頑張ってるよー」\nって言ってたのはこのことでした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、ツアーと並行しながら\n空中ブランコ頑張ってます(﹡ˆˆ﹡)\n1ヶ月後をお楽しみに♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/30/2781637/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}